# Revision 1 §7: confirm, choice, input and error boxes over the filer, and
# the screen after the last box closes. Fixture: alpha/ beta/ a.txt b.txt.
SNAP # initial
q SNAP # confirm
n s SNAP # choice
ESC DOWN DOWN DOWN c SNAP # input
ESC l "nowhere" RET SNAP # error
ESC SNAP # closed
UP UP UP SNAP # back_at_top
